| Command                             | Meaning                  |
| ----------------------------------- | ------------------------ |
| `hostname`                          | Show computer name       |
| `hostname -I`                       | Show IP address          |
| `cat /etc/resolv.conf`              | Show DNS configuration   |
| `cat /etc/hosts`                    | Show local name mappings |
| `getent hosts google.com`           | Resolve a hostname       |
| `nslookup google.com`               | Query DNS                |
| `dig google.com`                    | Detailed DNS query       |
| `dig +short google.com`             | Short DNS answer         |
| `systemctl status systemd-resolved` | Check DNS service        |
| `resolvectl status`                 | Show DNS status          |
